<SimpleLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy information for visitors and prospective clients of MassComm Solutions.">
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p>Last updated: 20 August 2026</p>
  <p>MassComm Solutions collects the information you voluntarily provide through our enquiry forms, including your name, company, contact details, city, event date, and message.</p>
  <h2>How we use information</h2>
  <p>We use submitted information to respond to enquiries, prepare event proposals, coordinate requested services, and maintain necessary business communication.</p>
  <h2>Form processing</h2>
  <p>Website enquiry forms are processed by FormSubmit and delivered to our business email. Please avoid including sensitive personal or financial information in your message.</p>
  <h2>Third-party content</h2>
  <p>The website embeds Google Maps and links to WhatsApp. Those services may process information according to their own privacy policies.</p>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>For privacy questions or deletion requests, email <a href="mailto:Info@masscommsolutions.pk">Info@masscommsolutions.pk</a>.</p>
</SimpleLayout>
